flowchart LR
    U[User Task] --> R[AgentRuntime]
    R --> P[Model Provider]
    P -->|tool decision| V[Tool Registry]
    V --> F[Fault Injector]
    F --> X[Bounded Tool Execution]
    X --> T[SQLite Trace Store]
    T --> W[Trace Viewer / Replay]
    T --> E[Independent Reliability Grader]
    E --> B[Versioned Batch Comparison]
    P -->|final report| R
